## Validation contract

- `standalone` means the project must behave as if cloned independently; a successful integration-workspace run never substitutes for it.
- `workspace` means the private meta-repository integration overlay is intentionally active.
- Use the commands above instead of inventing alternate build/test paths. A command is documented here only once it is known to work.
- If a documented command is stale, update this file as part of the task.
- Record secret names only; never secret values.
